/// support conditions - IPAM pool CIDR and Scope resource CIDR . Static
/// CIDR rules cannot have conditions. Static CIDR : A fixed list of CIDRs
/// that do not change (like a manual list replicated across Regions) IPAM
/// pool CIDR : CIDRs from specific IPAM pools (like all CIDRs from your
/// IPAM production pool) If you choose this option, choose the following:
/// IPAM scope : Select the IPAM scope to search for resources Conditions:
